  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Eighty-Eight True Yang Building holds Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s yellow apricot immortal essence. Water Pavilion, the rank seven Immortal Gu House protecting Fang Yuan from Giant Sun’s will, holds Fairy Mo Yao’s red date immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        639
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "house_water_pavilion",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_mo_yao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo Yao’s main body left about twenty beads. After years of running the house, five remain, and she treats that store as too small to turn the battle around.",
      "chapters": [
        640
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rank scale sits on ranks and realms.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_ranks_and_realms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Cheng’s rank seven blessed land produces red date immortal essence one rank higher than green grape immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        681
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-output",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_cheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At rank seven, immortal killer moves that consume green grape immortal essence become common methods, while those that consume red date immortal essence are uncommon hidden trump cards.",
      "chapters": [
        732
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-output",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals at rank seven have red date immortal essence. They face an earthly calamity every ten years, a heavenly tribulation every fifty years, and a grand tribulation every one hundred years, and after three hundred years they would become rank eight. Gu Immortals at rank six have green grape immortal essence. Immortal apertures at rank eight create white litchi immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        1007
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "calamity-intervals",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_aperture"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Liu Qing Yu’s blessed land, Fang Yuan leaves Liu Qing Yu’s rank seven red date immortal essence behind rather than take it, giving it to the duck land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        1152
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "given-to-a-land-spirit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qing_yu_blessed_land",
        "char_liu_qing_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan plans to annex Ye Lui Qun Xing’s rank seven star path blessed land so his cultivation will reach rank seven and he will start producing red date immortal essence. One hundred beads of green grape immortal essence can turn into one bead of red date immortal essence. Using rank seven Immortal Gu, the effect of one bead of red date immortal essence needs at least one hundred and thirty beads of green grape immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        1202
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "conversion-ratio",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_lui_qun_xing",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan reaches rank seven, the sovereign immortal aperture begins to produce red date immortal essence. He can also merge accumulated green grape immortal essence into red date immortal essence at one hundred to one. Using green grape immortal essence to activate rank seven Immortal Gu costs at least thirty percent extra; after the merge that loss is gone.",
      "chapters": [
        1206
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "own-production",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The merge is a widely used method. In Lang Ya blessed land he runs a mortal Gu formation that combines tens of thousands of green grape beads, and two beads of red date immortal essence form at the bottom.",
      "chapters": [
        1207
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "own-production",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While readying his killer move Saw Light Wheel against Fang Yuan’s divination tortoise transformation, Xia Fei Kuai consumes his own red date immortal essence rapidly.",
      "chapters": [
        1310
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "xia-fei-kuais-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_saw_light_wheel",
        "char_xia_fei_kuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With the rate of time in his sovereign immortal aperture slowed, it produces far less red date immortal essence than before, so Fang Yuan has to turn immortal essence stones into it, at one hundred immortal essence stones for one bead.",
      "chapters": [
        1316
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "converting-essence-stones",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Weakening Wu Yong’s finger wind dragon with rank seven killer moves puts an intense burden on Feng Jiu Ge’s rank seven red date immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        1389
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feng-jiu-ges-burden",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    }
  ],
